<title>USA: NYSE reviews listing status of Huntway.</title>
<headline>NYSE reviews listing status of Huntway.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that it is reviewing the eligibility for continued listing of Huntway Partners LP's common units, after the company filed chapter 11 bankruptcy.</p>
<p>The company filed for bankruptcy November 12 in U.S. Bankruptcy Court in Delaware.</p>
